{"ts":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"pm eval measures SEARCH ranking quality (nDCG/MRR golden queries, shipped via pm-u8n5/pm-22x2) but nothing measures whether pm context / pm next assemble the RIGHT working set — the core promise of 'project management = context management'. The adaptive relevance engine (pm-4k6b) will change assembly behavior; without a quality harness we cannot prove it is an improvement, tune signal weights, or catch regressions.\n\nProposal: extend the eval pattern from search to context assembly.\n- Golden workspaces: a small real-shaped snapshot plus pm-mi2x synthetic workspaces at 10k/100k scale.\n- Graded judgments: given agent state (focus item, active claim, plan step, query), the ideal context set with per-item relevance grades.\n- Rank-aware scoring (nDCG-style) over the assembled context and next ordering, plus token-budget adherence checks.\n- Phase 1 (now): baseline today's structural assembler — same before/after role pm-a22j plays for token cost.\n- Phase 2 (with pm-4k6b): per-signal attribution in eval output so weight tuning is evidence-driven; gate in CI like the search eval.\n\nSDK-first: the runner consumes only public SDK read primitives (pm-rjqr), so custom scorers from extensions are evaluable with the same harness."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-atfm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Context relevance evaluation harness: graded golden-workspace judgments for pm context/next quality"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["context","quality-gate","relevance","scale"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":480},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Golden corpus (one real-shaped and one synthetic pm-mi2x workspace) with graded judgments versioned in-repo; offline runner scores pm context and pm next with rank-aware quality metrics; baseline of the current structural assembler recorded before pm-4k6b lands; CI gate fails on quality regression beyond a documented threshold; harness consumes only public SDK read primitives; documented workflow for adding new judgment cases"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-9rxu"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-4k6b","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z"},{"id":"pm-mi2x","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z"},{"id":"pm-oslr","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-06T23:25:57.317Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"cb5a333a192adfd15a4887175d69e08e62f6ad3f289cb8347eef824081a0fef8","message":""}
