{"ts":"2026-07-06T23:51:07.144Z","author":"codex-agent","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T23:51:07.144Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Evaluation harness for context quality: graded workspaces and continuity scenarios that measure whether pm context/next return the right items under explicit token budgets."}],"before_hash":"f84dc8c751ac612c0b2a887f4e4280afc515903859cb5fff6f19724b84a6c390","after_hash":"f91d0486a13e639a6a6848fe340b2d3a4bf991d3f0a69d46aeab41c7a852415e","message":"Backfill concise description after splitting context evaluation into child slices"}
{"ts":"2026-07-06T23:51:08.193Z","author":"codex-agent","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T23:51:08.193Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-06T23:51:08.193Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Planning evidence 2026-07-07: pm-atfm remains the canonical quality harness for context/next relevance. Added non-duplicate child slices pm-lixy (graded scenario corpus across scratch, real-shaped, scale, and returning-agent continuity cases) and pm-xmp5 (offline runner + CI gate). Done definition should mirror search-eval rigor but score context assembly: rank-aware quality, required-item recall, continuity-delta coverage, and token-budget adherence. This keeps pm-4k6b weight tuning evidence-driven instead of aesthetic.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"f91d0486a13e639a6a6848fe340b2d3a4bf991d3f0a69d46aeab41c7a852415e","after_hash":"c11a2c80bff55bb4f206466e04d91072dedb19228a05c979b7ea9e7600962987"}
