{"ts":"2026-07-10T05:53:29.681Z","author":"codex-root-20260709","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-10T05:53:29.680Z","author":"codex-root-20260709","text":"Verification evidence 2026-07-10: full sandbox suite passed 270 files / 5,505 tests with exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. pm test-all over the seven active items passed 8 linked commands with 0 failures and 1 duplicate-safe skip. pnpm typecheck, contracts:check, lint (ESLint + 0 jscpd clones + static quality/token budget), docs-skills, context-eval, security scan, and audit all passed. Live CodeFactor reports A+ and 0 issues. Fresh packed npm install at /tmp/pm-cli-sdk-path-proof-XIsSsh activated 11 bundled packages in a path-target tracker, left caller extension files at zero, and passed CLI/SDK context plus isolated doctor with zero blocking failures. pm health is clean and history drift is zero."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-10T05:53:29.681Z"}],"before_hash":"3c5d34659bc648b77b9f4ec99324e64bb95e456f0af010c1d1f747a91e2dcdc0","after_hash":"4c40c9fd054abbb68637d7a168cb01b37df37c5a3cc198bb40541ef1745635ba"}
