{"ts":"2026-08-01T20:21:52.786Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e7309615869ce0c76b1741d3","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/8","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-01T20:21:52.786Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Evaluation design 2026-08-01: the context harness should stratify three-item scratch, real-shaped team, returning-agent, high-contention fleet, deep-history, adversarial metadata, and million-item synthetic scenarios. Judgments distinguish required, useful, redundant, misleading, and unsafe context. Gates report recall at budget, NDCG, first-relevant rank, continuity delta coverage, blocker and decision coverage, duplication, tokens per useful fact, latency, memory, and ranking stability. Counterfactual and ablation runs isolate each signal; frozen seeds and snapshot fingerprints make regressions reproducible. Quality thresholds are profile-specific so optimizing the million-item case cannot degrade the seconds-old scratch project."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-01T20:21:52.786Z"}],"before_hash":"716c1f3900b731021ed3a3c6d7cedf0a1c08e420c34507eaa5bc37604ee5b72c","after_hash":"68be2f7fe4583054def5c80c1056d9584c24e9b62f7068b1e70c5f311e7080af"}
